---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ashiatsu Barefoot Massage | Nikki Leonardi Bodywork Traverse City" description="Ashiatsu — barefoot massage using overhead bars. The deepest pressure you've probably ever felt. One of very few practitioners in Northern Michigan. Book now.">
  <div class="pt-16">
    <section class="relative py-24 px-6 bg-[#162040] overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-15">
        <img src="/images/ashiatsu-1.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#162040] to-[#162040]/60"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-4">Signature Service</p>
        <h1 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-5xl md:text-6xl text-[#f0f4ff] leading-tight mb-6">
          Ashiatsu.<br/>Barefoot massage.<br/><em class="text-[#c8a84b]">The deepest pressure<br/>you've probably ever felt.</em>
        </h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d1428]">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-[#c8a84b]/70 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Ashiatsu is a form of massage where I use my feet — supported by overhead bars — instead of my hands. The result is pressure that is uniquely consistent, deeply sustained, and capable of reaching tissue that hands simply cannot.</p>
          <p>Clients describe it as "feeling like two people are working on you at the same time." First-timers are usually surprised. Then they rebook.</p>
          <p>Ashiatsu is particularly effective for deep fascial work, chronic tension patterns, and anyone who carries dense muscle tissue and has never found a therapist who could get there.</p>
          <p class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-xl text-[#f0f4ff] italic">"The deepest most comfortable pressure ever. 1st time doing this type of massage and I can't wait for my next one."</p>
          <p class="text-[#c8a84b]/40 text-sm">— Matt Schram</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img src="/images/ashiatsu-2.png" alt="Ashiatsu barefoot massage technique" class="w-full mb-4" />
          <img src="/images/ashiatsu-3.png" alt="Nikki Leonardi barefoot work" class="w-full" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-[#162040]">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-8">Who It's For</p>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          {['You\'ve spent years telling massage therapists "a little deeper" and still never found the pressure you needed.',
            'You carry a lot of dense muscle tissue from training, labor, or years of physical work.',
            'You have chronic fascial restrictions that haven\'t responded to standard massage.',
            'You want to know what it actually feels like to have tissue fully addressed — not just worked on the surface.'].map(item => (
            <div class="flex gap-3 text-[#c8a84b]/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-[#c8a84b] shrink-0">—</span>
              {item}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="mt-12">
          <a href="/book" class="btn-primary">Book an Ashiatsu Session</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
